Usage: agent-deck mcp detach <session-id> <mcp-name> [options]

Detach an MCP from a session.
Codex-compatible sessions always use the global Codex config.

Options:
  -global
    	Remove from global config instead of local config (Codex always uses global)
  -json
    	Output as JSON
  -q	Minimal output (short)
  -quiet
    	Minimal output
  -restart
    	Restart session to unload MCP immediately

Examples:
  agent-deck mcp detach my-project exa           # Detach from local (Codex uses global)
  agent-deck mcp detach my-project exa --global  # Detach from global
  agent-deck mcp detach my-project exa --restart # Detach and restart
